---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'September 3, 2026';
---
<BaseLayout title="Cookie Policy" description="How AI DEV (inteligenciaartificialdev.com) uses cookies.">
  <section class="container legal-page">
    <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        This Cookie Policy explains what cookies are, how AI DEV
        (inteligenciaartificialdev.com) uses them, and how you can control
        them.
      </p>

      <h2>What are cookies</h2>
      <p>
        Cookies are small text files stored on your device when you visit a
        website. They help the site remember information about your visit,
        like preferences or usage patterns.
      </p>

      <h2>How we use cookies</h2>
      <p>
        We use a small number of essential cookies to keep the site
        functioning, and may use analytics cookies to understand how
        visitors use the site so we can improve it. If we introduce
        third-party advertising in the future — such as Google AdSense —
        those partners may set their own cookies to serve relevant ads.
      </p>

      <h2>Types of cookies we use</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Essential:</strong> required for the site to work correctly (e.g. remembering your cookie preference).</li>
        <li><strong>Analytics:</strong> help us understand aggregate traffic and usage patterns.</li>
        <li><strong>Advertising (future):</strong> if we run ads, third-party ad networks may use cookies to serve and measure them.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Managing cookies</h2>
      <p>
        Most browsers let you block or delete cookies through their
        settings. If you use Google services, you can also manage ad
        personalization through
        {' '}<a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google's Ad Settings</a>.
        Blocking essential cookies may affect how parts of the site work.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this policy as the site evolves. We'll update the
        "Last updated" date above when we do.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact us</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about our use of cookies? Reach out through our
        {' '}<a href="/contact">contact page</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    padding-block: 56px 80px;
    max-width: 68ch;
  }

  .updated {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin: 12px 0 32px;
  }
</style>
